#
# Generic
#
ModuleAutoBlogName = AutoBlog
ModuleAutoBlogDesc = Generate blog articles of your websites with AI, from a queue of topics processed by a scheduled job, then publish them after review.
AutoBlogGenerateArticles = Generate blog articles with AI (AutoBlog)

#
# Admin page
#
AutoBlogSetup = AutoBlog setup
AutoBlogSetupDesc = Articles are generated with the AI service of the AI module. The service, the key, the model and the base prompt for web pages ("textgenerationwebpage") are defined into the setup of the AI module.
AutoBlogAISetup = Setup of the AI module
AutoBlogAIServiceUsed = The AI service used is <b>%s</b>.
AutoBlogAINotConfigured = The AI service <b>%s</b> has no API key. Articles can't be generated until it is configured.
AutoBlogCronInfo = Articles in queue are generated by the scheduled job "AutoBlogGenerateArticles" (disabled by default). Enable it and choose its frequency into the <a href="%s">list of scheduled jobs</a>. Its parameter is the max number of articles generated at each run.
AUTOBLOG_DEFAULT_WEBSITE = Default website of new topics
AUTOBLOG_DEFAULT_WEBSITEHelp = Website selected by default when creating a new topic
AUTOBLOG_AUTHOR_ALIAS = Author alias of published articles
AUTOBLOG_AUTHOR_ALIASHelp = Name shown as author of the blog posts created on the website
AUTOBLOG_TARGET_WORDS = Target number of words of an article
AUTOBLOG_MAX_ATTEMPTS = Max number of attempts of the scheduled job
AUTOBLOG_MAX_ATTEMPTSHelp = After this number of failed generations by the scheduled job, the topic is set in error and no more processed
AUTOBLOG_AI_TIMEOUT = Timeout of a request to the AI service (seconds)
AUTOBLOG_AI_TIMEOUTHelp = Generating a full article can take more time than the default timeout of HTTP requests

#
# Menus
#
BlogTopics = AI blog topics
NewBlogTopic = New topic
WebsitesEditorialSetup = Editorial setup of websites

#
# Blog topic
#
BlogTopic = Blog topic
AutoBlogPageAlias = Page alias
AutoBlogPageAliasHelp = Alias (URL name) of the page that will be created on the website. Leave empty to build it from the title.
AutoBlogLangHelp = Language of the article, among the languages of the selected website (its main language is selected by default).
AutoBlogKeywordsHelp = Keywords the article should contain, separated by a comma
AutoBlogInstructions = Instructions for this article
AutoBlogInstructionsHelp = Angle, target, points to cover... They are sent to the AI after the editorial setup of the website. Corrections are added at the end.
AutoBlogDatePlanned = Generate not before
AutoBlogDatePlannedHelp = The scheduled job will not generate the article before this date. Leave empty to generate it at the next run.
AutoBlogDateGeneration = Generation date
AutoBlogDatePublication = Publication date
AutoBlogNbAttempts = Nb of generation attempts
AutoBlogContent = Content
AutoBlogStatusQueued = In queue
AutoBlogStatusGenerated = Generated
AutoBlogStatusPublished = Published
AutoBlogDeleteTopic = Delete topic
AutoBlogPutInQueue = Put in queue
AutoBlogPutBackInQueue = Put back in queue
AutoBlogGenerateNow = Generate now
AutoBlogConfirmGenerate = The article will be generated now with AI. This may take a few minutes. Continue?
AutoBlogCorrect = Regenerate
AutoBlogEditArticle = Edit article
AutoBlogCorrectArticle = Regenerate the article
AutoBlogConfirmCorrect = The instructions entered below will be added to the instructions of the article, then the article will be generated again.
AutoBlogExtraInstructions = Additional instructions
AutoBlogPublish = Publish
AutoBlogUpdatePublication = Update publication
AutoBlogConfirmPublish = The article will be published online as a blog post of the website <b>%s</b>. Continue?
AutoBlogConfirmUpdatePublication = The blog post already published on the website <b>%s</b> will be replaced with this version of the article. Continue?
AutoBlogArticleGenerated = Article generated
AutoBlogArticlePublished = Article published
AutoBlogGeneratedArticle = Generated article
AutoBlogPublishedPage = Published page
AutoBlogEditInWebsiteEditor = Edit in website editor
AutoBlogWebsiteSetupReminder = Editorial setup of the website, sent to the AI with the instructions of the article
AutoBlogWebsiteSetupEmpty = No editorial setup defined for this website
AutoBlogAIRequest = Request sent to the AI
AutoBlogShowAIRequest = Show the full request that will be sent to the AI to generate the article
AutoBlogAIRequestDesc = Request (JSON) that will be sent to the AI service <b>%s</b> with the model <b>%s</b> to generate the article. The meta description is then asked with a second shorter request.
AutoBlogAIRequestOnlyPrompt = This version of Dolibarr can't build the request without sending it (method Ai::buildPayload() not found), so only the prompt built by the module is shown.
AutoBlogNoWebsite = No website found. Create a website with the Website module first.
AutoBlogCronResult = %s article(s) generated, %s failure(s)
AutoBlogErrorWebsiteNotFound = Website with id %s not found
AutoBlogErrorEmptyAnswer = The AI service returned an empty answer
AutoBlogErrorNothingToPublish = There is no generated article to publish
AutoBlogErrorAliasAlreadyUsed = A page with alias "%s" already exists on the website. Change the page alias of the topic.

#
# Editorial setup of websites
#
WebsitesEditorialSetupDesc = Information on each website, sent to the AI with the instructions of each article generated for this website.
AutoBlogEditorialSetup = Editorial setup
AutoBlogWebsiteOnline = Online
AutoBlogWebsiteOffline = Offline
AutoBlogWebsiteDescription = Website description
AutoBlogDifferentiators = What sets you apart from competitors
AutoBlogTargetAudience = Target audience
AutoBlogTargetLocation = Target location
AutoBlogTargetLocationHelp = Keep empty for all countries
AutoBlogAllCountries = All countries
AutoBlogUrlCompetitors = URL of competitors
AutoBlogUrlProductFeed = URL of product catalog (Google shopping feed)
AutoBlogUrlSitemap = URL of sitemap
AutoBlogUrlStyleExample = Writing style example URL
AutoBlogUrlStyleExampleHelp = Public URL of an existing article whose writing style is an example to follow. Its text is sent to the AI as a model of style (tone, sentences, structure), its content is not copied.
AutoBlogOneUrlPerLine = One URL per line. Not yet used for the generation.
AutoBlogNotUsedYet = Not yet used for the generation.
AutoBlogGenericInstructions = Additional generic instructions
AutoBlogGenericInstructionsHelp = Tone, style, things to avoid... One instruction per line. They are added to the generation of each article of this website.
